window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>She's my nemesis.</p> <p>My prisoner. </p> <p>I'll make her beg for mercy.</p> <p>I'll make her scream my name. </p> <p>I'll make her mine.</p> <p>Sheena Hurston's been a thorn in my side for years. But when she tries to bring my family to ruin, I'm done playing games.</p> <p>She will pay for what she's done. No one comes before my family. Sheena belongs to me.</p>"; 
